type: software
title: "Signal Viewer"
abstract: >-
  An offline desktop application for exploring, comparing and reporting on recorded time-series
  data - flight-test runs, drone flight logs (ArduPilot, PX4, MAVLink), CAN, and simulation output -
  with pass / fail checks for continuous integration and a numerical validation of its computations.
